This add-on outputs names and descriptions of items and skills in other languages to your tooltip.
Also can replace some LinkInChat.(in latest version, LinkInChat of Item only.)

[B]DependsOn:[/B]

[LIST]
[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info2666-LibMultilingualName.html"]LibMultilingualName[/URL]

[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info7-LibAddonMenu.html"]LibAddonMenu-2.0[/URL]
[/LIST]

[B]DependsOn(Optional):[/B]

[LIST]
[*][URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info1480-ItemSetBrowser.html"]Item Set Browser[/URL]
[/LIST]

